msgstr "The cover shown right as a book opens normally comes from the library's cached thumbnail, which can look soft on higher-resolution screens. When on, SimpleUI instead reads the cover straight from the book file for that moment (also covers books never opened before, which otherwise show no cover at all) — at the cost of a brief extra pause while opening, since the file has to be read twice. Cover on close is unaffected either way: it already reads the full-quality cover from the open book."

